a file diff. The rails: (1) an op on the update owner, would-restart? TREE, answered by the same restart-for over runtime-for that landed! asks, so a session or a land asks the system before it lands, never a diff of its own; bin/land prints its answer before main moves. (2) :seon.config.build/inputs is a build input of itself: a change to the list is a restart, and restart-for says so by name. Proof, red first: seon.source-test/a-change-to-the-input-list-is-a-restart."
